# Delvers — independent campaign archive

**Delvers is a separate campaign set in its own fictional reality.** Its continuity is independent of both [The Wastes](../world/README.md) and [Inverse](../inverse/README.md). Shared performers, familiar fantasy terms or similar names do not establish shared people, places, cosmology or history.

**Status 2026-10-26:** **All S1E01–S1E12, S2E00 and played S2E01–S2E12** have ASR-provisional research; **S2E00 is narrated fiction during Season One**, not a played Season Two episode. [S2E01](episodes/S2E01.md) documents the Snake Island missing fortnight and Potato Grove; [S2E02](episodes/S2E02.md) documents the completed **Wight Wedding** and the guest's recovered **Deck of Many Things**. **S2E12 ends Season Two/second arc; [S3E12 — KOA is not A-OK](episodes/S3E12.md) ends Season Three, THIRD story arc, and ENTIRE Delvers campaign (owner-confirmed).** [S3E01 — Maximize The Yield](episodes/S3E01.md) now researched (ASR-provisional): immediately follows Ball, seven elf cures, Evelyn departs home; [ASR comparison](../reports/DELVERS_S3E01_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md) 8.12% inter-ASR text disagreement; [S3E02 — Call your Mummy](episodes/S3E02.md) is now ASR-provisionally researched and **completes three-month montage into Silver City**, with [6.93% P/Q8 text disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E02_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md); **[S3E03 — Thank You For The Deposit](episodes/S3E03.md) now researched** ([9.22% independent ASR text disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E03_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md)); guest Dumbledwark obtains C4 licence, Zoltar promises future grounding relief, reporter steals warlock tome; **no raid yet**. **[S3E04 — Take a photographical, it'll last longer.](episodes/S3E04.md) now researched** ([9.59% full-export ASR textual disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E04_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md)): four heroes actually enter C4 and slay behir, Iron Monkey survives minus an arm, crystal opens exit; **[S3E05 — Dungeon Goes Poof](episodes/S3E05.md) now researched** ([8.41% inter-ASR textual disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E05_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md)): visiting centaur envoy [Destroying Angel](world/characters/destroying-angel.md) leads conditional diplomacy at [Deep Winds Spa](world/places/deep-winds-spa.md), Koh destroys filter ooze after rescuing Krandal, and a telepathic invitation to Koh cuts off unanswered; **[S3E06 — A naked man can be slippery](episodes/S3E06.md) now researched** ([7.92% inter-ASR textual disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E06_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md)): Koh actually accepts the aboleth's telepathic invitation and sees triangle/three-slot gate, later finds matching mummy catacombs with party; party returns three Silver badges, learns Amulet of Health/Ring of Evasion, remains grounded, and Krandal's hook-horror egg hatches; **[S3E07 — A Shirt Full of Mayo](episodes/S3E07.md) now researched** ([8.28% inter-ASR TEXT disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E07_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md)): Koh actually forges lift pass and uses blood detector, guest [Goggles Granny](world/characters/goggles-granny.md) helps solve [black-slime puzzle](world/places/black-slime-key-chamber.md), no actual mayonnaise used, recovered [dried-heart jar](world/items/dried-heart-jar.md) fits ONE of THREE older triangle-gate altar slots and **two remain empty**; **[S3E08 — I Smell a Rat Ball](episodes/S3E08.md) NOW RESEARCHED** ([10.01% two-ASR textual disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E08_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md)): Krandal farm revolt/Koh bounty/Evelyn asylum are **cranium-rat ILLUSIONS**, not events; [Black Basilica](world/places/black-basilica.md) and [Radiant Lance](world/characters/radiant-lance.md), Koh's recovery of hook-horror organ urn; **first bat urn removed from old altar so TWO urns in Evelyn bag and THREE recesses EMPTY**; Deep Winds Spa **1,000gp EACH**, no completed rest; **[S3E09 — I Am The Natural One](episodes/S3E09.md) NOW RESEARCHED** ([8.24% two-export textual disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E09_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md)): spa night completes; guest [Barclay Vandergeist/Bendergeist](world/characters/barclay-vandergeist.md) and [Chance lantern](world/items/chance-lantern.md) in [right-stair grick puzzle](world/places/right-stair-grick-urn-complex.md); cross-linked golems destroyed, Evelyn takes THIRD GRICK-HEAD URN and now carries ALL THREE, triangle gate remains SEALED and ALTAR EMPTY; party uses forest-dungeon/Veggie Sticks tree travel to Atomer ~6pm after **Nondetection makes Guild badges fall off** (tracking inferred not verified). **[S3E10 — Sad in a boney kind of way](episodes/S3E10.md) NOW RESEARCHED** ([7.83% inter-ASR textual distance](../reports/DELVERS_S3E10_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md)): Evelyn gives THREE urns to KOH, Zoltar confirms divination tracking, reporter tip Cassius at Wildfire estate **verified by ACTUAL RELEASE**, Cassius returns to Guild and grants **20k each** for next-day Khalazar campaign; Evelyn earns Loran Radiant Armour and kills school hook horror, Krandal recruits Nopa + TEN skeleton minotaurs (including Chad Brad) and receives Pelor's Devotee's Censer at dawn; **no descent into sealed triangle gate yet**. **[S3E11 — There's a Bat in The Balcony](episodes/S3E11.md) NOW RESEARCHED** ([6.99% P/Q full-export TEXT disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E11_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md)): Cassius-sponsored final expedition ACTUALLY descends, THREE urns installed and ancient Dolbluth mummy opens triangle gate then releases urns and crumbles. Full group ACTUALLY ENTERS DAWNLESS DUNES and GATE CLOSES behind. Koh finds shattered blue crystal, elite group infiltrates pyramid with enthralled elves, Withers/Wildfire and apparently Hissia in upper balcony. Giant skeletal bat arrives; Evelyn ACTUALLY lures it away by elk while Darmah begins preparations for evacuees, but NO teleport or Khalazar fight yet. **[S3E12 — KOA is not A-OK](episodes/S3E12.md) RESEARCHED AND ENDS THE ENTIRE DELVERS CAMPAIGN (Season Three / Third Arc)** ([9.56% exact P/Q text disagreement](../reports/DELVERS_S3E12_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-26.md)): Evelyn ACTUALLY KILLS gigantic skeletal bat, Darmah FIRST teleport ACTUALLY rescues Withers/Wildfire/Phelan/other captives, Koh and Dominic retrieve Hissia/Keeves, Nopa carries Hissia. Trio INSERTS three organ urn contents into hollow Khalazar, psychic-city boss battle nearly kills Krandal/Evelyn, Koh saves cleric and cleric heals paladin, trio JOINTLY pierces Khalazar's heart in REAL bedchamber and DESTROYS HIM. SECOND Darmah portal returns allies as temple collapses; TEN skeletal minotaurs including Chad Brad/Corgan fall into inert bones. Hissia awakens and kisses Nopa; one-year epilogue Koh Guild teacher, Krandal flourishing farm, Evelyn school/Atomer/Blackwood affairs and Gentleman Cavalier search; rebuilt farm Delvers tower with Evelyn Blackwood–Ethan Renald/Renault Travail wedding INVITATION (not ceremony), unopened royal letter. **CAMPAIGN PLAY COMPLETE; no S3E13**. The authentic **S1E03 has been recovered and analyzed** from three `(corrected)` transcript exports, restoring continuous first-season text coverage. The older S1E03-labelled exports still contain S1E04 and are preserved as source-identity evidence. 37 episode IDs; 77 SRT files; 38 inventoried MP3 copies. No audio listening completed.

